{"id":"sw-c96adf","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-e8394454-a6a9-4974-80c9-923c10f75132","text":"## Final summary\n\nReplaced the flame-chart timeline with a scrolling frame time graph per user feedback.\n\n**Frame Time graph** — \"Frame Time\" egui window:\n- 300-frame ring buffer of `FrameSample { dt_ms, cpu_ms, gpu_ms }`\n- Vertical bar chart scrolling left, newest on right\n- GPU bars (green), CPU bars (blue, translucent), dt tick marks (yellow, red if over 30 FPS budget)\n- Reference lines at 60 FPS (16.67 ms) and 30 FPS (33.33 ms)\n- Auto-scaling Y axis, hover tooltip for legend\n- Zero dependencies — pure egui custom painting\n\nAll tests pass, clippy clean. Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-08-05T22:50:26.482489Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.222 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
