{"id":"sw-ff12d4","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-22edcb95-3fd6-4ed8-9892-905abff0226d","text":"## Summary\n\nRenamed `crates/viewer` → `crates/sandbox` and moved `worldgen.rs` + `model_gen.rs` from the engine crate into the sandbox crate.\n\n**Files changed:**\n- `crates/viewer/` → `crates/sandbox/` (git mv)\n- `crates/engine/src/worldgen.rs` → `crates/sandbox/src/worldgen.rs` — `crate::` imports changed to `smallworld_engine::`\n- `crates/engine/src/model_gen.rs` → `crates/sandbox/src/model_gen.rs` — same import rewrite, added `use smallworld_engine::wgpu`\n- `crates/engine/src/lib.rs` — removed `pub mod worldgen` and `pub mod model_gen`\n- `crates/sandbox/src/main.rs` — replaced engine imports with `mod worldgen` / `mod model_gen` local modules\n- `crates/sandbox/Cargo.toml` — package renamed to `smallworld-sandbox`\n- `Cargo.toml` (workspace) — updated members, added `[profile.dev.package.smallworld-sandbox] opt-level = 3`\n- `Makefile` — `VIEWER` → `SANDBOX`, target help text updated\n\n**Rationale:** Engine is a library providing rendering and data structures. Worldgen and model_gen are test content — they belong in the dev harness, not the engine's public API.\n\n**Decisions made:** None beyond the spec.\n\n**Status:** `cargo fmt --check`, `clippy -D warnings`, 29 tests (25 engine + 4 worldgen), and `make smoke` all pass. Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-08-06T07:10:39.85012Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.222 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
