{"id":"sw-480d26","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"title":"Benchmark harness: scripted camera orbit with per-frame metrics","status":"DOING","estimate":5,"assignee":"Claude Code \u003cagent@macbook.local\u003e"},"created_at":"2026-08-06T07:43:43.396899Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.222 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"sw-480d26","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-1ddddf2f-64bc-404a-b965-4c91e9e4dc81","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded `--bench [preset] [--duration N]` CLI mode to the sandbox.\n\n**New file:** `crates/sandbox/src/bench.rs` — `BenchConfig`, `BenchState`, `BenchSample` types, `parse_args()`, orbit camera logic, and report printing with min/avg/max/p99 stats.\n\n**Modified:** `crates/sandbox/src/main.rs` — bench mode plumbed through `App` → `RunState`, orbit camera replaces WASD input during bench, metrics collected per frame, report printed and exit on completion.\n\n**Modified:** `Makefile` — added `bench` target: `make bench`, `PRESET=Stress make bench`, `DURATION=10 make bench`.\n\n**Rationale:** Quantitative, reproducible performance data from a deterministic camera orbit. Comparable across runs for before/after engine changes.\n\n**Decisions made:**\n- Orbit radius derived from preset grid bounds (60% of max horizontal extent, minimum 5m)\n- Orbit height set above scene center (60% of vertical extent, minimum 3m)\n- One full orbit per bench duration for consistent angular coverage\n- GPU timestamps reported as EMA-smoothed averages (same source as the debug panel)\n\n**Status:** fmt, clippy, 29 tests, smoke all pass. Bench verified on Default (5s) and Stress (3s) presets."},"created_at":"2026-08-06T07:49:09.824743Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.222 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
