{"id":"sw-2a9a70","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Scale grid to 1 km world","description":"\nIncrease grid dims to ~625×64×625 (1 km × 100m × 1 km). Verify coarse gen timing, memory budget, and rendering at scale. The shader, pager, and CoarseMipGrid already parameterize on dims — this is primarily a sandbox preset change with potential perf tuning.\n","status":"PLANNED","parent_id":"sw-dacdf2","estimate":2,"sort_order":"b0U","dependencies":[{"source_id":"sw-2a9a70","target_id":"sw-625b6d","kind":"depends_on"}],"labels":["feature","sandbox"]},"created_at":"2026-08-06T12:15:18.882681Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.222 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"sw-ce99bd","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Progressive enhancement pager: generate finer levels near camera on demand","description":"\nInstead of jumping straight from coarse mip (levels 2-4) to full 16³ voxels, the pager generates intermediate levels (8³, then 4³) as the camera approaches. Each level upgrade is cheaper than full gen, spreading the cost over time.\n\nThis is an engine change — the pager needs to track per-cell resolution level and request upgrades rather than full loads.\n","status":"PLANNED","parent_id":"sw-dacdf2","estimate":3,"sort_order":"b0V","dependencies":[{"source_id":"sw-ce99bd","target_id":"sw-625b6d","kind":"depends_on"}],"labels":["feature","engine"]},"created_at":"2026-08-06T12:15:22.84428Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.222 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
